            "description": "# datrafilcha\n\n\nData transformed/filtred charted.\n\n\nGive CSV, choose column, choose function, get plot.\n\n### Data filters/transformers\n\n\n\n### Sample code\n\n```\nfrom datrafilcha import DataFiltersFacade\n\n\nconfiguration = {\n    'id': 'UniqValues',\n    'column_name': <COLUMN NAME>,\n    'desc': True,\n    'limit': 5,\n}\n\ndata_filters_facade = DataFiltersFacade()\nhtml_plot = data_filters_facade.csv_column(filter_configuration,\n                                            data_source_file,\n                                            column)\n\nwith open('new_plot.html', 'w') as f:\n    f.write(html_plot)\n```\n",
